# A Sides argument beyond RtInt's range. GMANRIBParse::nextInt must reject
# 4294967297 with RIE_RANGE instead of truncating it to 1 (4294967297 mod
# 2^32).
#
# A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section, "The
# desync convention."
Display "malformed_out.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Sides 4294967297
Sphere 0.5 -0.5 0.5 360
WorldEnd
